																																			<h2 class="block-splitContent__title fade-in">Where the world's brightest minds shape tomorrow's solutions </h2>
																						<div class="block-intro__text-content fade-in">
							<p>Home to a thriving, collaborative ecosystem of over 300 high tech companies, researchers and institutions, High Tech Campus Eindhoven is your gateway to state-of-the-art facilities, world-class expertise and a dynamic network.</p>

